       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LEAP.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
         01 WS-YEAR   PIC 9(4).
         01 WS-RESULT PIC 9(1).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       LEAP.
         IF FUNCTION MOD(WS-YEAR, 4) IS EQUAL TO 0 
            AND FUNCTION MOD(WS-YEAR, 100) IS NOT EQUAL TO 0 
            OR FUNCTION MOD(WS-YEAR, 400) IS EQUAL TO 0
         THEN
            SET WS-RESULT TO 1
         ELSE
            SET WS-RESULT TO 0
         END-IF.

       LEAP-EXIT.
         EXIT.
       